  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Hacia una educacin ms inclusiva: Transformando la Escuela Rural</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards a more inclusive education: Transforming the Rural School</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es apoyar al Gobierno de Honduras a aumentar el acceso y mejorar la calidad educativa en zonas rurales focalizadas y poblaciones vulnerables. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) fortalecer la demanda por servicios educativos mediante incentivos monetarios y estrategias de prevencin y revinculacin a estudiantes; (ii) fortalecer los servicios educativos de la niez y adolescencia retornada; (iii) fortalecer la oferta por servicios educativos mediante la mejora de infraestructura escolar, estrategias de enseanza docente para el desarrollo de habilidades fundacionales, del Siglo XXI y verdes y programas alternativos innovadores; y (iv) fortalecer la capacidad institucional de la SEDUC para el monitoreo, gestin y toma de decisiones del sistema educativo.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to support the Government of Honduras in increasing access to and improving the quality of education in targeted rural areas and vulnerable populations. The specific objectives are: (i) to strengthen the demand for educational services through monetary incentives and strategies for prevention and re-engagement of students; (ii) to strengthen educational services for returned children and adolescents; (iii) to strengthen the supply of educational services by improving school infrastructure, teaching strategies for the development of foundational skills, 21st-century and green skills, and innovative alternative programs; and (iv) to strengthen the institutional capacity of SEDUC for monitoring, management, and decision-making in the educational system.</narrative>
  </description>
